      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Apache Wicket is a component oriented Java web framework. With proper mark-up/logic separation, a POJO data model, and a refreshing lack of XML, Wicket makes developing web-apps simple and enjoyable again.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk provides a short introduction to the framework&amp;#39;s concepts: components, behaviors and models. We&amp;#39;ll take a short look at integrating with Spring and integrating with JQuery. For the test infected we&amp;#39;ll cover testing your web pages with Wicket&amp;#39;s internal test framework. But most importantly we&amp;#39;ll take a look at the new Wicket release 1.5 and see what has changed for the better and worse&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
